Cell["\<\
Run import code before creating any figures. Edit import/export file \
names/locations for your local system and, if necessary, edit loaded \
parameter space to match your imported run. Default size is \
tmax2000_dims21,4,1,1000, corresponding with 1000 runs of 2000 time steps at \
each of 21 autocorrelation levels, 4 mean temperatures, and 1 standard \
deviation of temperature.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9176095306889257`*^9, 
  3.917609613454101*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0bc49c9f-10a4-4713-bb11-\
87c31504b12c"],

